==== clickSound ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Parameter for weapons. The parameter specifies the sound that will be played when the trigger is pressed.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ClickSound = M9Jam,
</syntaxhighlight>
